  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f7657f10-a3e4-4403-a941-928f5bd774ba.png\" alt=\"Serene Seasons Logo\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fglitchfiend.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_30ec20ea-5378-428a-bd0a-be21297b5ed5.png\" alt=\"Follow on Bluesky\" width=\"220\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fGlitchfiend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f430a7ef-e185-440d-b5b3-99734548f12c.png\" alt=\"Follow on X\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_7d333cda-4140-43b3-bbf2-d0644e385d2b.png\" alt=\"Join our Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_db9999be-2c6a-45e2-8b5a-ac137a40758d.png\" alt=\"Support on Patreon\" width=\"236\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dAdubbzG%2540gmail.com%2526cy_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_4b997f21-953a-40bf-9b62-4142c6df34e4.png\" alt=\"Donate via PayPal\" width=\"218\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<hr>\n<h4>Serene Seasons 是一款為 Minecraft 添加季節的模組。草和樹葉的顏色會在一年中隨季節變化，而在冬季，氣溫會下降並允許在某些通常不會下雪的生物群系中降雪。季節還會影響各種其他功能，如作物生長、天氣等！</h4>\n<h2>資訊與條款</h2>\n<hr>\n<h3>Minecraft 1.20.4 及以上版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_a952cee2-0572-4d67-a33c-f5bfde8f4376.png\" alt=\"GlitchCore Icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a>！Fabric 版本還需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</h3>\n<p><em>*對於 1.20.1 版本，mod 版本 9.1.0.0 及以上也同樣需要 GlitchCore。</em></p>\n<p><em>您可以將此模組包含在由 CurseForge 托管的整合包中，只要您不重新託管該模組，僅使用我們直接上傳的版本，不出售整合包或通過任何方式出售該模組的額外訪問權限，並遵守您所用模組版本的許可證中列出的所有條款。</em></p>\n<h2>更多來自 Glitchfiend 的作品</h2>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f51ae5df-ff9f-4a50-a39e-16467fb0e877.png\" alt=\"Biomes O&#x27; Plenty Logo\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tough-as-nails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_6406d094-d853-4f83-b92b-49accc3b5fd7.png\" alt=\"Tough As Nails Logo\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a></p>",
